          "DisplayName": "Unquenchable Second Heart",
          "Tooltip": "Maximum life +40.\nRecords 25% of enemy damage, up to 60 life.\nAfter 6 unharmed seconds, returns 1 life every 0.1 seconds.\nNew damage or unequipping cancels remaining recovery; cooldown 20 seconds.\nNo self-harm, trap, environmental or fatal-damage recovery. Does not revive."
        },
